{
    "title": "Multimodal demo: catalogue + two image models",
    "description": "VLA-C composite: component catalogue plus two compact continuum I+alpha image models, one tangent at the phase centre and one 7.2 arcmin away on a TAN grid (regridded). Generate the models with scripts/make_multimodal_demo_models.py and check the result with scripts/check_multimodal_run.py.",
    "telescope": "VLA",
